{"text": "EMORANDUM\n\n~\noH\nShi American SobecerConpan,\n\nFebruary 26, 1981\n\nMr. W. J. Moore, Advertising Manager\n\nSprinkle, III, Vice President - Research and Development\n\ncma [zon] on\n\nProject PMUH\n\nWe are forwarding to your attention four cartons of Project PMUH\ncigarettes as per your request of February 19. All cigarettes\nhave been prepared with LUCKY 100's blend and flavoring and yield\n4-mg \"tar\" per cigarette. \u2018Iwo of the four cartons have been pre-\npared with cork tipping while the remaining two were fabricated\nwith white tipping material, End flaps of the respective cartons\nare coded \"Cork\" or Waite.\u201d\n\nShould you have questions regarding these cigarettes, please call\n\n\u00ab\n\nODL.\n\ncc: Mr. T. C. Hays\nVice President - Marketing",
